      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Speech-to-Text**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. I believe it's a solid fit for streaming microphone audio and providing interim transcripts. Now, I will begin implementing the provider-specific integration within the `stream_microphone.py` file.\n\n\n**Implementing the Library**\n\nI am now integrating the `google-cloud-speech` library within `stream_microphone.py`. The core function, `stream_microphone`, will manage audio capture, send it to Google's service, and generate interim transcripts. This function will handle all the provider-specific nuances of the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API, and will return the audio transcript to the caller of the function. I plan to avoid any comments or docstrings in the code, for brevity.\n\n\n",
