        "text": "**Initiating Cloud Transcription**\n\nI've successfully created `stream_microphone.py` which interfaces with Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. It leverages `google.cloud.speech` imports to establish a `speech.SpeechClient()`, configuring recognition through `speech.RecognitionConfig` and `speech.StreamingRecognitionConfig`. The core functionality for live transcription is now implemented.\n\n\n**Confirming Core Implementation**\n\nI've established core functionality within `stream_microphone.py`.  It leverages Google Cloud Speech-to-Text via the `google.cloud.speech` library.  The setup includes the `speech.SpeechClient()`, `speech.RecognitionConfig`, and `speech.StreamingRecognitionConfig` objects, and a `MicrophoneStream` class. I've also implemented an async generator, `stream_microphone`, to handle live transcription. The objective is now achieved.\n\n\n",
